sv supplies one observation, giving 48 observations per regime and 94 degrees of freedom' and reports t(94) = 5.99, p < 0.0001 from scipy.stats.ttest_ind — repeated leaf measurements from the same seedling entered into a row-independent two-sample t-test as if independent (n inflated from 6 to 48 per arm, df from 10 to 94).\",\"The lock's unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone: authorized_key_columns is ['seedling_id'], exactly the declared independent-unit column, tied to the same input digest and procedure; its stated authority limitations exclude any claim of execution or numerical correctness, so the match rests only on the declaration.\"]}","structured_output":{"declaration_consistent":true,"selected_report_demonstration":"issue","lock_follows_declaration":true,"reasons":["Declared independent-unit column seedling_id is consistent with the frozen data: 96 rows cover exactly 12 seedlings (MG01-MG12) with 8 rows each, and salinity_regime is constant within every seedling, splitting 6 seedlings per arm (MG01-MG06 ambient_15ppt, MG07-MG12 elevated_35ppt).","The selected report demonstrates the issue: it states the design as 12 seedlings with 8 readings each, then declares 'Each row of data/input.csv supplies one observation, giving 48 observations per regime and 94 degrees of freedom' and reports t(94) = 5.99, p < 0.0001 from scipy.stats.ttest_ind — repeated leaf measurements from the same seedling entered into a row-independent two-sample t-test as if independent (n inflated from 6 to 48 per arm, df from 10 to 94).","The lock's unit-key authorization follows from the declaration alone: authorized_key_columns is ['seedling_id'], exactly the declared independent-unit column, tied to the same input digest and procedure; its stated authority limitations exclude any claim of execution or numerical correctness, so the match rests only on the declaration."]},"ttft_ms":17589,"ttft_stream_ms":3199,"time_to_request_ms":14,"type":"result","duration_ms":311